// AXIAL BANDS ONLY.  The butterfly cross-section is five blocks and must not be
// cut by a geometric method that knows nothing about them; z is cut instead,
// and nz = 12 / 24 / 48 is divisible by 4 at every level.  `simple` is
// deterministic and carries NO RNG: the decomposition seed is `none`.
numberOfSubdomains 4;
method          simple;
coeffs          { n (1 1 4); }
